  <main>
    <h1>Home Page Comparison Mockup</h1>
    <p class="lede">Top-of-page capture highlighting the redesign focus on clarity, trust signals, and structured storytelling.</p>

    <section class="grid">
      <figure>
        <div class="label"><span></span>Legacy 6f102a4 (July 30, 2025)</div>
        <div class="frame">
          <img src="../screenshots/legacy-6f102a4/home-desktop.png" alt="Legacy home page screenshot" />
          <div class="callout" style="top: 10%; left: 7%;">Hero leads with dense technical copy</div>
