          <img src="../screenshots/next-js-2025/home-desktop.png" alt="Redesign home page screenshot" />
          <div class="callout blue" style="top: 12%; left: 8%;">Benefit-first hero with focused CTA</div>
          <div class="callout blue" style="top: 33%; left: 8%;">Structured modules guide the story</div>
          <div class="callout blue" style="top: 56%; left: 8%;">Trust + compliance moved above the fold</div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="notes">
      <div><strong>Legacy gaps:</strong> Mixed hierarchy, long paragraphs, and scattered CTAs make scanning difficult. The value proposition leans technical before merchant outcomes.</div>
      <div><strong>Redesign gains:</strong> Tight narrative flow (hero → value → process → trust), clearer navigation, and stronger visual rhythm for merchant-focused messaging.</div>
